{"seq":2,"slug":"mathematics-advanced","title":"理科方向数学进阶","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"理科方向数学进阶-简介\">理科方向数学进阶 简介</h1><p>数学进阶是高中理科方向中对数学能力要求最高的提升课程。高中数学的常规内容侧重基本概念和计算技能，而数学进阶则进入分析学、高等代数和竞赛数学的初步领域，为有志于理工科深造的学生搭建从高中到大学数学的过渡桥梁。这些内容不仅在自主招生和数学竞赛中直接考察，也为大学阶段的微积分、线性代数等核心课程奠定坚实基础。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向数学基础扎实、希望进一步拓展数学能力的高中理科学生，适合已掌握函数、数列、不等式等高中核心内容的学习者。全书共分三章，按照&quot;分析-代数-竞赛&quot;的路径逐步深入。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>数学分析初步</strong>引入极限与连续的严格概念，讲解微分学的基本运算与应用、积分学的核心思想与计算方法，帮助学生从直觉化的函数理解过渡到严格的分析思维，为微积分的系统学习打下根基。第二章<strong>高等代数初步</strong>从矩阵与行列式的基本概念出发，讲解线性方程组的系统求解方法和向量空间的初步思想，培养学生用代数结构化的眼光看待方程和变换问题，这是理工科各分支的通用数学语言。第三章<strong>竞赛数学</strong>精选数论、组合数学和证明方法三个竞赛核心板块，通过经典问题的分析和解题策略的训练，培养学生的数学直觉和逻辑推理能力。</p>\n<p>推荐按章节顺序学习。数学分析和高等代数相对独立，可以交替推进；竞赛数学适合在前两章基础上进行专项训练。每个主题都应通过大量习题巩固理解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mathematical-analysis","title":"数学分析初步","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/mathematical-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"limits-continuity","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 极限与连续","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/mathematical-analysis/limits-continuity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"differentiation","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 微分学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/mathematical-analysis/differentiation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"integration","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 积分学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/mathematical-analysis/integration"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"advanced-algebra","title":"高等代数初步","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/advanced-algebra","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"matrices","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/advanced-algebra/matrices"},{"seq":2,"slug":"determinants","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 行列式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/advanced-algebra/determinants"},{"seq":3,"slug":"linear-systems","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 线性方程组","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/advanced-algebra/linear-systems"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"competition-math","title":"竞赛数学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/competition-math","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"number-theory","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 数论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/competition-math/number-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"combinatorics","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 组合数学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/competition-math/combinatorics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"proof-techniques","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 证明技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/competition-math/proof-techniques"}]}]}